Haan — direction aur quality bar world-class rakha hua hai, lekin ek important distinction hai:

Count ke liye padding nahi — har record ka engineering purpose hai.

Implementation-aware — concepts ke saath code applicability, failure modes, testing aur verification cover ho rahe hain.

Production concerns — security, performance, concurrency, lifecycle, dependency boundaries, compatibility aur failure containment include ho rahe hain.

Framework-specific behavior — FastAPI/Starlette, Django, SQLAlchemy/Alembic waghera ko generic theory ke bajaye implementation boundaries ke saath cover kar raha hoon.

Invalid/failure knowledge bhi first-class rakhi ja rahi hai, sirf “correct code” nahi.

Version/provenance/verification fields maintain kiye ja rahe hain; jahan actual execution nahi hui, NOT_EXECUTED hi rahega.

Deduplication — pehle ke D27 batches ke concepts repeat karne ke bajaye new implementation gaps target kar raha hoon.

Edge cases — cancellation, partial failure, concurrency, resource exhaustion, malformed input, compatibility aur security boundaries ko include kar raha hoon.

Retrieval/engineering usability — records ko aise structure mein rakha ja raha hai ke baad mein Brain unhein code generation, debugging, testing aur reasoning mein retrieve kar sake.


